Buck Bowers, played by Douglas Fowley.

10
00:52:06,315 --> 00:52:12,315
Ape, played by Stan Haze.

11
00:57:18,947 --> 00:57:24,947
Boy, played by Damon Douglas.

12
01:02:31,578 --> 01:02:37,578
The Mexican, played by Hector Morales.

13
